Lemma world_ok_all : ltac2:(zQ "30!hme!lk9!pk1>1s$0>1g$0@3$2$1^2^1").
Proof.
ltac2:(KReplay.run1 (kr_t_BsMainCells ()) [] "h01gh11sp;1p;2p;3p;4g02G=j15Tg02HAj21Tg006Wj30Tg02IEj12Tg00=Qj24Tg00m@j43Tg00A1R0g01NcR1#5f1'1g00AQR2500%21f0'1=0021402R2P2C3X00W1o"). Qed.
Section PMCv2.
  Context (sp0 : word) (rdraw : EntryDraw) (inp : ProcInput) (brk0z : Z) (X : pm_syms) (m : word -> option byte) (MC : PMC sp0 rdraw inp brk0z X m).
End PMCv2.

